    "raw": "What caused the mass die-off and near extinction of the X'i is a debated mystery to us. Speculations range from invasion to events such as meteor strikes or gamma ray bursts. Whatever happened, nearly 98% were almost simultaneously rendered intert, their cores dying along with them.",
    "value": "艾肯种族大规模死亡乃至濒临灭绝的原因，至今仍是争议未解的谜团。推测众说纷纭，从外敌入侵到流星撞击乃至伽马射线爆发等假说皆有提出。但无论发生了什么，近98%的艾肯几乎在同一时间陷入沉寂，其核心亦随之死亡。"
