  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "I, personally, believe it was a devastating contagious disease in the form of a parasite. By studying some X'i cores that managed to survive the event in recently abandoned ghost towns, I found plenty of small holes that, when scanned, showed a map of unnerving tunnels. Small objects laid within, perhaps eggs, but evaporated when samples were attempted.",
    "value": "我个人倾向于认为，原因是一种具有毁灭性的寄生虫型传染病。通过研究一些在近期被遗弃的“鬼城”中幸存下来的艾肯核心，我发现了大量微小孔洞，扫描后显示出一幅令人不安的隧道网络图景。孔内有微小物体，似为虫卵，但在尝试取样时瞬间蒸发。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "With my hypothesis, the only thing I'm missing is the catalyst for this disease. We may be fortunate in uncovering more hidden truths in the coming days as we investigate more dead cities. A single sample is all we need!",
    "value": "基于这一假设，许多疑问得以迎刃而解。未来随着我们对更多“鬼城”的调查，或许有幸能揭开更多被隐藏的真相。我们所需要的，仅仅是一个样本！"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/longContentPages/0",
    "raw": "What caused the mass die-off and near extinction of the X'i is a debated mystery to us. Speculations range from invasion to events such as meteor strikes or gamma ray bursts. Whatever happened, nearly 98% were almost simultaneously rendered intert, their cores dying along with them.\nPersonally, I believe it was a devastating contagious disease in the form of a parasite. By studying some X'i cores that managed to survive the event in recently abandoned ghost towns, I found plenty of small holes that, when scanned, showed a map of unnerving tunnels. Small objects laid within, perhaps eggs, but evaporated when samples were attempted.\nWith my hypothesis, many questions are easily answered. We may be fortunate in uncovering more hidden truths in the coming days as we investigate more dead cities. A single sample is all we need!",
    "value": "艾肯种族大规模死亡乃至濒临灭绝的原因，至今仍是争议未解的谜团。推测众说纷纭，从外敌入侵到流星撞击乃至伽马射线爆发等假说皆有提出。但无论发生了什么，近98%的艾肯几乎在同一时间陷入沉寂，其核心亦随之死亡。\n我个人倾向于认为，原因是一种具有毁灭性的寄生虫型传染病。通过研究一些在近期被遗弃的“鬼城”中幸存下来的艾肯核心，我发现了大量微小孔洞，扫描后显示出一幅令人不安的隧道网络图景。孔内有微小物体，似为虫卵，但在尝试取样时瞬间蒸发。\n基于这一假设，许多疑问得以迎刃而解。未来随着我们对更多“鬼城”的调查，或许有幸能揭开更多被隐藏的真相。我们所需要的，仅仅是一个样本！"
  }
]